#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Logical drives are accessed via the SCSI disk driver (I<sd>), tape drives "
#| "via the SCSI tape driver (I<st>), and the RAID controller via the SCSI "
#| "generic driver (I<sg>), with device nodes named I</dev/sd>*, I</dev/st>*, "
