"[B<disable_device_id_wildcards=>{B<0>|B<1>}] [B<disable_heartbeat=>{B<0>|"
"B<1>}] [B<disable_ctrl_shutdown=>{B<0>|B<1>}] [B<lockup_action=>{B<none>|"
